#: plugin_wallpaper.cpp:194
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>You selected a remote image. It needs to be saved to your local disk to be used as a wallpaper.</p>"
"<p>You will now be asked where to save the image.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Du hest en feern Bild köört. Wenn Du dat as Achtergrundbild bruken wullt, mutt dat na Dien Fastplaat sekert warrn.</p>"
"<p>Du warrst nu fraagt, wo dat Bild hen sekert warrn schall.</p>"
"</qt>"

